        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                "word": "pharmacovigilance",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "733ff2b4-eb6e-4e47-8ab3-12382b6d430f",
                        "entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pharmacovigilances"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "537a1d35-5460-3a60-a886-97f9210d040c",
                        "entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Activité consistant à enregistrer et évaluer les réactions résultant de l’utilisation des médicaments, afin d’assurer leur sécurité d’emploi dans des conditions normales d’utilisation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1405442-fed6-4655-a66f-2e2205601ae1",
                                "sense_id": "537a1d35-5460-3a60-a886-97f9210d040c",
                                "text": "Ces logiciels seront aussi utiles en santé publique. Dans toutes les grandes affaires de pharmacovigilance, comme le Mediator ou le valproate (Dépakine), les informations étaient publiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec090bd8-1e93-4e7c-a644-2c640bf05e2b",
                                "sense_id": "537a1d35-5460-3a60-a886-97f9210d040c",
                                "text": "Les rapporteurs et co-rapporteurs, délégués du CSP, assurent l’évaluation scientifique des produits lors de la demande initiale puis au cours de leur vie post-AMM, y compris les aspects de pharmacovigilance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a8596011-bb0f-39c8-9d1e-6eea5910041a",
                        "entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dispositif et ensemble des moyens permettant cette surveillance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f59033a-91c1-4203-8520-7acf79cc165b",
                                "sense_id": "a8596011-bb0f-39c8-9d1e-6eea5910041a",
                                "text": "Problème : comme l’a correctement souligné Loïc Signor, les cas listés dans cette partie du document correspondent aux cas transmis aux centres de pharmacovigilance pour investigation (jusqu’au 1ᵉʳ juillet 2021), et non les cas pour lesquels le lien de cause à effet a été établi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e64cf04-5ac4-44a7-9ed3-ce45661fae1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pharmakovigilanz",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "818b0812-1c65-4a6a-b487-d6a2438dd79d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "target_lang_word": "pharmacovigilance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pharmacovigilance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4220122c-b69b-3207-a671-02903c795f9f",
                                        "entry_id": "68fe4a47-c62b-3a01-889d-79b4bb2c0ac4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The detection, assessment, understanding and prevention of adverse effects of medicines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2c71329-4ea1-4228-80fe-5aef7a5cdc6a",
                                                "sense_id": "4220122c-b69b-3207-a671-02903c795f9f",
                                                "text": "In our experience, a request concerning suspected drug toxicity (or an adverse effect) needs to be dealt with in greater detail than other chemical agents, to obtain information on the animals affected (species, breed, age, physiological and pathological status) and on the suspect product (conformity, dose administered, storage conditions, etc.). These led us to introduce a specific request form for drugs, called a ‘pharmacovigilance form’, used since October 1988."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99cab492-a941-4823-ae75-8712ffa9dad9",
                                                "sense_id": "4220122c-b69b-3207-a671-02903c795f9f",
                                                "text": "But it appears repurposing is possible in another crucial phase of drug development—post-marketing surveillance or pharmacovigilance, which essentially identifies adverse side effects of drugs. Experts say “repurposed” pharmacovigilance would look for and understand beneficial side effects of drugs that may surface during their development or use."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd95855b-8a8f-4574-9319-b9c841e07be3",
                                                "sense_id": "4220122c-b69b-3207-a671-02903c795f9f",
                                                "text": "Since it [the European Medicines Agency] began operating in 1995, the agency has become a central actor regarding various aspects of pharmaceuticals regulation and has a crucial role in providing the infrastructure for EU [European Union] pharmacovigilance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47f11e61-ee39-4ddf-b8c8-37e10165c682",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d15678e-2572-3991-bd40-8b5fcc892549",
                        "target_lang_word": "drug safety monitoring",
